1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,198
TaxTech is AI-Assisted Withholding Tax Preparation for accountants.

2
00:00:04,198 --> 00:00:09,797
Upload a ledger, review unclear withholding treatment with AI, approve the

3
00:00:09,797 --> 00:00:14,663
invoice evidence and generate income and sales tax withholding drafts.

4
00:00:14,663 --> 00:00:17,692
This demonstration uses invented data only.

5
00:00:18,992 --> 00:00:22,572
Start by uploading an Excel or CSV ledger.

6
00:00:22,572 --> 00:00:28,150
TaxTech detects the columns, and you confirm the date, description, account,

7
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:33,728
debit, credit, and reference mappings. Preview the actual rows before importing.

8
00:00:33,728 --> 00:00:38,391
Here, three entries are imported: office supplies, an unclear professional

9
00:00:38,391 --> 00:00:41,388
engagement, and an internal bank transfer.

10
00:00:42,688 --> 00:00:47,391
Now request AI review. The application calls NVIDIA Nemotron through Nebius

11
00:00:47,391 --> 00:00:52,986
Token Factory at runtime. The response proposes a treatment, explains its reasoning,

12
00:00:52,986 --> 00:00:57,688
and asks for missing information. A professional engagement could mean different

13
00:00:57,688 --> 00:01:03,040
services. The description alone is not proof of the correct tax treatment.

14
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:06,977
The accountant checks the supporting invoice.

15
00:01:06,977 --> 00:01:11,851
In this invented example, the engagement is a statutory audit fee.

16
00:01:11,851 --> 00:01:17,285
The reviewer selects the supported income and sales tax cases, enters the invoice

17
00:01:17,285 --> 00:01:20,801
bases, confirms eligibility, and records a note.

18
00:01:20,801 --> 00:01:25,835
For section one fifty three, income withholding uses the gross payment including

19
00:01:25,835 --> 00:01:30,310
sales tax. The own-bank transfer is excluded with a reason.

20
00:01:30,310 --> 00:01:32,548
AI never approves these decisions.

21
00:01:33,848 --> 00:01:38,304
Once every entry has a decision, generate the income batch.

22
00:01:38,304 --> 00:01:42,521
The configured calculation produces sixteen thousand, two hundred and fifty

23
00:01:42,521 --> 00:01:47,135
rupees on two hundred and thirty-three thousand rupees of gross payments.

24
00:01:47,135 --> 00:01:52,148
Inspect the lines before approval. The completed example also provides an internal

25
00:01:52,148 --> 00:01:56,206
PDF summary. This is not an official payment slip.

26
00:01:57,506 --> 00:02:02,285
If a user gets stuck, Ask TaxTech explains the current workflow and offers

27
00:02:02,285 --> 00:02:07,064
relevant navigation. This is a real response from the same NVIDIA model on

28
00:02:07,064 --> 00:02:12,967
Nebius. It guides the user; it cannot file a return, make a payment, or approve

29
00:02:12,967 --> 00:02:14,232
a tax decision.

30
00:02:15,532 --> 00:02:21,223
This demo is configured for financial year twenty twenty-four to twenty twenty-five,

31
00:02:21,223 --> 00:02:27,637
Tax Year twenty twenty-five. Tax constants can be modified for any tax year,

32
00:02:27,637 --> 00:02:32,877
together with its applicable rules and effective dates, then validated before

33
00:02:32,877 --> 00:02:36,129
activation. Unsupported cases need specialist review.

34
00:02:36,129 --> 00:02:40,556
TaxTech: AI suggests, you approve, configured rules calculate.
